    <span class="badge">
      <span class="dot"></span>
      Performance & Growth Marketing
    </span>

    <h1>
      <span class="hero-line-plain">Stop lighting money</span><br>
      <span class="hero-line-two"><em>on</em> <span>FIRE</span></span>
