    <p class="hero-lead">
      Don’t just spend on ads. Invest in a growth strategy that makes every rupee work harder.
    </p>

    <p class="hero-small">
      Performance marketing for ambitious brands.<br>
      Paid ads, UGC creative systems, SEO/AEO/GEO, and growth strategy — built to scale profitably, not just spend budget.
